    {
      "card": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "icon": "page",
        "label": "Lesson 30 • Negotiating a Salary Offer",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "Donna calls Marina to tell her the good news—she got the job. Marina wisely decides to negotiate for a higher salary."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Marina, it's Donna Harris from American Steel Enterprises. I've got great news. We'd like to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "make you an offer"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "That's fantastic!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Doann: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Our HR department will go over the "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "nitty-gritty"
                },
                {
                  "text": " of the offer with you, but let me give you "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "the big picture"
                },
                {
                  "text": " now. The base salary* will be $45,000."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I'm really excited about this opportunity. I should mention that I'm "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "weighing another offer"
                },
                {
                  "text": " with a higher base salary. "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "Is there any room to negotiate?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "What did you "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "have in mind"
                },
                {
                  "text": "?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Well, my other offer is for $50,000. Can you match it?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "That's "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "out of our range"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". Let's "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "split the difference"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". We'll go up to $47,500."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Can we say $48,000?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "No, I'm afraid not. Our final offer is $47,500."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "This sounds good, but I'd like to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "sleep on it"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". Can I call you back tomorrow?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Yes, but please "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "touch base with"
                },
                {
                  "text": " me first thing in the morning so we can "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "get the ball rolling"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". We've got several other candidates interested in the position."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "The next day..."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Donna, I've had a chance to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "review your offer"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". I'm going to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "stand my ground"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". To accept your offer, I really need $48,000."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Donna: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Marina, you "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "drive a hard bargain"
                },
                {
                  "text": "! But, okay, I think that can be arranged. Can you start on Monday, 9 a.m.?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Mariana: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "That'll be perfect. See you then!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
